# #99 item 8: lambda parameters accept the C parser's tok_is_ident_like set
# (soft keywords prev/at and the six question words), not just plain idents.
f is (prev) => prev + 1
print of (f of 4)
g is (what, how) => what * how
print of (g of [3, 5])
h is (at) => at - 1
print of (h of 10)
sq is (x) => x * x
print of (sq of 7)
